<div class="s cur">The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog</div>
<div class="w cur" style="font-weight:300">300 Small things — £12,400 · $49</div>
<div class="w cur" style="font-weight:400">400 Small things — £12,400 · $49</div>
<div class="w cur" style="font-weight:600">600 Small things — £12,400 · $49</div>
<div class="w cur" style="font-weight:800">800 Small things — £12,400 · $49</div>
<div class="w cur" style="font-weight:900">900 Small things — £12,400 · $49</div>
</div>
<div class="row"><span class="label">REFERENCE</span>
<div class="s ref">ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ</div>
